Answer: TwistT1.reverse() recursively reverses the queue from [B, C, D] to [D, C, B]. Player A finishes their turn and is enqueued at the back, leaving the queue as [D, C, B, A]. The next four turns belong to D, C, B, and A.

(T5) Player lands on Mirage.

